# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CFB Model Training Pack — LICENSED MATERIAL, NEVER COMMIT
#
# cfdb_model_pack/LICENSE is personal, non-commercial and original-purchaser-only, and
# explicitly prohibits uploading the pack to a repository or sharing it with non-purchasers.
# The extracted notebooks, training_data.csv and guides ARE the licensed material; the zip is
# only the wrapper, so ignoring *.zip alone is not enough.
#
# This repo is private today and going public has been discussed. A private repo carrying
# licensed data in its history is a landmine that a later .gitignore does not defuse — git
# history is not retroactively cleaned by ignoring a path.
#
# Model OUTPUTS are our own work, but they are derived from the licensed training data and
# are large and regenerable, so they stay local too and are ingested from disk.
cfdb_model_pack/
model_outputs/
*.zip
